This directory includes the unmodified PostMark 1.5 benchmark (postmark-1_5.c, NetApp), adopted from the Eaudit suite. The script `../run_pm` runs multiple postmark instances in parallel. Each instance operates in its own subdirectory to enhance parallelism. Workload sizes and additional parameters are configured in `pm-config.sm` and `pm-config.reg`, with the suffix denoting the benchmark's approximate runtime.

Compilation is required using the makefile before executing the scripts. As postmark is coded in an antiquated C dialect, be prepared for numerous compiler warning messages.
